 5 Strength

Weight: 3~

@7009 = ~Symbol of Sehanine Moonbow~

@7010 = ~Symbol of Sehanine Moonbow
This enchanted symbol of the elven goddess Sehanine Moonbow was bestowed upon the elves of the Hand of the Seldarine who ventured into the wilderness to protect and explore their lands. How it fell into the hands of slavers remains a mystery, but its power endures. The wearer of this amulet gains limited divine abilities, including the power to detect traps and discern the alignment of creatures and objects in the vicinity.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities: Trap Ward, twice per day
                  Know Alignment, twice per day~

@7011 = ~The Mercykillers are a powerful faction based out of the planar city of Sigil. This ring is given out to Mercykiller assassins when they are sent out to punish those who have broken the laws of Sigil. Often these assassins will roam as far as the Prime Material Plane.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Stealth Strike: +20%

Weight: 0~

@7012 = ~Created by the Energy Blades spell. When thrown at an opponent, it causes 1d4+5 points of missile damage as well as an additional 1d10 points of electrical damage.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +10
Damage: 1d4+5, +1d10 electrical damage
Damage type: Slashing

